SQSH1
rate=24000
lyrics=1440
audio=635786

[00:15.17]Swear I couldn't sleep a wink last night
[00:18.20]No point in turning off the lights
[00:21.73]Not the same without your head on my shoulders
[00:24.91]Growing pains, but I don't wanna get older
[00:28.01]Almost like we left it all on read
[00:31.48]Couple feelings never laid to rest
[00:34.50]Didn't know that the party was over
[00:37.85]And it's true that I need you here closer
[00:42.25]Burning photos
[00:45.55]Had to learn to let go
[00:48.45]I used to be
[00:53.05]
[00:55.08]Somebody in another skin (another skin)
[00:59.52]I heard that you're happy without me
[01:04.52]And I hope it's true (I hope, I hope it's true)
[01:12.93]It kills me a little, that's okay
[01:17.58]'Cause I'd die for you
[01:22.84]You know I'd still die for you
[01:28.07]
[01:38.70]I hope you're getting everything you needed
[01:42.22]Found the puzzle piece and feel completed
[01:45.23]Just wanted you to know every reason
[01:48.78]Hope you really know that I mean that
[01:51.67]Couldn't see the forest from the trees
[01:57.65]Only time we speak is in my dreams
[02:04.52]
[02:06.59]Burning photos
[02:09.93]Had to learn to let go
[02:12.68]I used to be
